WEBVTT

01:36.570 --> 01:39.870
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.060 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 12]

01:42.190 --> 01:42.420
No.

01:42.420 --> 01:43.990
I want to play with the dog.

01:44.270 --> 01:45.280
Fenghua!

01:46.590 --> 01:47.330
Look.

01:47.509 --> 01:48.180
Here.

01:48.270 --> 01:49.570
This is your little brother.

01:49.670 --> 01:50.340
When you have time,

01:50.340 --> 01:51.950
take him for a walk around the street.

01:51.950 --> 01:52.950
It's his first time here.

01:52.950 --> 01:53.750
Fenghua is busy.

01:53.750 --> 01:54.810
She needs to do her homework.

01:54.840 --> 01:56.690
The college entrance exam is next year.

01:56.950 --> 01:58.550
She doesn't have time.

01:58.580 --> 01:59.610
I have time. I have time.

01:59.870 --> 02:01.320
Homework can be done anytime.

02:01.340 --> 02:02.030
Let's go, little brother.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.110
I'll take you out to play.

02:03.110 --> 02:04.070
There's no need to be polite with your sister.

02:04.070 --> 02:04.950
I want to go play by the river.

02:04.950 --> 02:05.750
Fenghua.

02:05.950 --> 02:08.710
You don't have to buy too many of those osmanthus cakes that I like!

02:08.960 --> 02:10.570
Two catties would be enough!

02:10.990 --> 02:13.470
I haven't heard her call me Grandma since I got here!

02:13.550 --> 02:14.990
Who taught her such manners?

02:14.990 --> 02:15.830
What do you mean she didn't?

02:15.870 --> 02:16.710
She called you as soon as she came in.

02:16.710 --> 02:17.740
You didn't hear it?

02:17.870 --> 02:19.720
My ears are deaf. I didn't hear it!

02:20.970 --> 02:22.180
Sister-in-law,

02:22.270 --> 02:23.430
I didn't hear it either.

02:23.450 --> 02:24.890
Then your hearing must be pretty bad.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.150
Alright, Mom,

02:26.190 --> 02:26.710
don't be angry.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.510
What kind of mother is she?

02:27.510 --> 02:28.270
She's just a bad person.

02:28.270 --> 02:29.980
Can't even raise a child properly.

02:30.230 --> 02:32.329
Like mother, like daughter.

02:32.790 --> 02:34.020
She's always been like this.

02:40.370 --> 02:41.720
What's your name?

02:41.990 --> 02:44.170
You mean my original name or my current one?

02:44.510 --> 02:46.000
How many names do you have?

02:46.040 --> 02:47.770
I used to be called Xiaojun,

02:47.950 --> 02:50.070
but now Grandma calls me Xiaobao.

02:50.070 --> 02:51.150
Bao as in "baby."

02:51.430 --> 02:52.540
Here you go, kid.

02:53.550 --> 02:55.560
Are you from the same village as my grandma?

02:57.150 --> 02:58.360
Then where do you live?

02:58.990 --> 03:00.270
I forgot.

03:04.790 --> 03:05.790
Adopted?

03:05.810 --> 03:07.030
What were you thinking?

03:07.350 --> 03:08.310
Calm down.

03:08.510 --> 03:09.760
Aren't I here to discuss it with you?

03:09.790 --> 03:10.710
What's there to discuss?

03:10.800 --> 03:12.070
It's already been decided!

03:12.510 --> 03:13.420
I'm going to talk to Maotian.

03:13.420 --> 03:14.770
Why isn't he back yet?

03:15.870 --> 03:16.430
Mom.

03:16.550 --> 03:18.470
I'm in charge of this family now.

03:18.510 --> 03:20.510
If there's anything going on, you should tell me.

03:20.510 --> 03:21.670
What is there to tell you?

03:21.710 --> 03:23.350
It's a major matter of the Xia family!

03:23.630 --> 03:25.170
Outsiders should keep their mouths shut!

03:25.230 --> 03:27.130
Mom, Mom, calm down.

03:27.230 --> 03:28.640
Let me talk to my sister-in-law.

03:29.350 --> 03:30.579
Sister-in-law.

03:30.820 --> 03:33.220
I have to criticize you a bit.

03:33.270 --> 03:37.150
Our Xia family has three branches with over a dozen people,

03:37.230 --> 03:38.230
with my brother being the only male...

03:38.230 --> 03:39.990
Wasn't it originally five branches?

03:39.990 --> 03:41.410
Why are there only three branches now?

03:41.430 --> 03:42.640
Where did the other two go?

03:42.730 --> 03:43.950
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

03:43.980 --> 03:45.420
Whether it's three branches or five,

03:45.510 --> 03:47.000
shouldn't we all live our own separate lives?

03:47.020 --> 03:48.700
When Maotian and I first came here,

03:48.730 --> 03:49.980
life was so hard,

03:50.000 --> 03:52.620
yet I didn't see any of you guys caring about us.

03:53.110 --> 03:54.850
Who told you guys to leave back then?

03:54.870 --> 03:56.790
If you didn't drag him away,

03:56.790 --> 03:59.740
would Maotian have left home to make a living?

03:59.790 --> 04:01.760
Why don't you take him back then?

04:01.790 --> 04:03.290
I'm not getting involved in this.

04:03.310 --> 04:04.170
Mom.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.130
Honghong.

04:06.950 --> 04:08.120
Son, you're back!

04:09.340 --> 04:11.110
I missed you so much.

04:12.430 --> 04:13.140
Gosh.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.770
You've lost weight.

04:14.950 --> 04:15.590
Look how thin you've become.

04:15.630 --> 04:17.300
Look at my brother, he's all sweaty.

04:17.329 --> 04:18.700
-He's sweating all over.
-Mom,

04:18.810 --> 04:22.010
there must be a reason why you and Honghong are back, right?

04:22.070 --> 04:23.310
You're finally back.

04:23.340 --> 04:24.590
Listen to what your mother has to say.

04:25.700 --> 04:28.110
It's good news, wonderful news!

04:28.110 --> 04:28.950
Wonderful news!

04:28.950 --> 04:31.240
You couldn't find better news even if you searched with a lantern!

04:31.430 --> 04:32.290
You couldn't!

04:32.390 --> 04:33.710
What good news?

04:34.150 --> 04:35.159
Your mother

04:35.230 --> 04:36.920
thinks Fenghua isn't good enough because she's a girl,

04:37.070 --> 04:39.190
so she bought you a boy from someone else

04:39.350 --> 04:40.800
to be our son.

04:45.830 --> 04:47.020
Isn't it great news?

04:47.040 --> 04:48.290
It's great, isn't it?

04:48.540 --> 04:50.060
Now you have a son.

04:50.230 --> 04:52.180
The family line will continue.

04:52.230 --> 04:54.070
You're a father again!

04:54.120 --> 04:55.750
I'm an aunt again!

04:55.790 --> 04:57.840
I have a grandson now!

04:58.060 --> 05:00.150
Look how happy my brother is.

05:00.230 --> 05:01.070
What?

05:01.470 --> 05:02.230
Is that true?

05:02.260 --> 05:03.410
Grandma told me that

05:03.510 --> 05:05.430
your family only has one daughter

05:05.510 --> 05:08.220
and there is no male heir, so I'm here to be the son.

05:08.280 --> 05:11.760
In the future, I'll get all the family inheritance.

05:12.550 --> 05:13.510
Family inheritance?

05:14.080 --> 05:15.240
Did my grandma not tell you

05:15.240 --> 05:16.150
about our family's situation?

05:16.350 --> 05:17.480
Your family has a big ship,

05:17.510 --> 05:18.840
weighing around a thousand tons, right?

05:22.740 --> 05:24.560
This kid is so mischievous.

05:24.620 --> 05:26.840
Fenghua, who is he?

05:30.910 --> 05:31.580
Mom!

05:32.130 --> 05:33.710
What were you thinking!

05:33.790 --> 05:34.950
What era are we living in?

05:34.970 --> 05:36.090
How can your thinking still be so feudal?

05:36.190 --> 05:37.610
I'm not being feudal!

05:37.670 --> 05:38.710
It's because

05:38.820 --> 05:39.670
girls

05:39.790 --> 05:41.620
can't be recorded in the family genealogy!

05:41.670 --> 05:42.750
If you don't have a son,

05:42.770 --> 05:44.430
who will continue your family line when you get old?

05:44.510 --> 05:45.720
Who will?

05:45.720 --> 05:47.270
If it can't be continued, then so be it!

05:48.210 --> 05:48.800
I don't even know what I'm doing with my life yet!

05:48.800 --> 05:49.800
Isn't that Fenghua's grandma?

05:49.800 --> 05:51.909
Who can control what happens after death?

05:51.930 --> 05:53.010
Son!

05:53.230 --> 05:53.950
Then our Xia Family

05:53.950 --> 05:55.820
will have no descendants!

05:56.230 --> 05:58.290
Back in the Jiajing period, our Xia Family

05:58.310 --> 06:00.340
was a prestigious clan!

06:00.380 --> 06:02.700
The family genealogy is this thick!

06:02.750 --> 06:05.110
I can't allow our bloodline to stop here

06:05.110 --> 06:06.060
just because of you

06:06.190 --> 06:07.630
and your good-for-nothing wife!

06:07.650 --> 06:09.730
Aren't you worried that your father wouldn't be able to rest in peace?

06:09.760 --> 06:11.910
Our father wouldn't be able to rest in peace!

06:11.930 --> 06:13.490
My father wouldn't be that petty!

06:14.550 --> 06:18.020
God! God!

06:18.050 --> 06:19.450
Mom. Mom.

06:19.470 --> 06:20.850
Oh, my darling!

06:20.880 --> 06:22.690
Come out and see this!

06:22.840 --> 06:23.330
Mom.

06:23.360 --> 06:24.610
Stop crying. Stop it.

06:24.630 --> 06:27.040
Look at your good-for-nothing son!

06:27.070 --> 06:28.970
Mom.

06:29.160 --> 06:29.760
Mom.

06:29.850 --> 06:30.990
Get up.

06:31.020 --> 06:32.710
You're just upset that we don't have a son, right?

06:32.750 --> 06:35.140
It's simple. Just let your son divorce me

06:35.170 --> 06:36.980
and find someone else to give birth to a son for your family!

06:37.010 --> 06:37.659
What are you talking about?

06:37.690 --> 06:38.130
Let me tell you.

06:38.150 --> 06:40.050
I, Li Yan, am content with just having a daughter.

06:40.090 --> 06:41.370
I absolutely won't raise someone else's child!

06:41.400 --> 06:43.000
Enough, can't you just endure a little?

06:43.030 --> 06:43.670
Haven't I endured enough?

06:43.690 --> 06:44.770
You don't get to decide!

06:44.810 --> 06:46.600
You don't get to decide.

06:46.620 --> 06:47.909
I don't get to decide my family's affairs?

06:47.950 --> 06:49.230
What, so you're to decide them?

06:49.300 --> 06:51.110
Mom, look, the neighbors are all here.

06:51.110 --> 06:53.090
Let's talk back inside.

06:53.230 --> 06:54.750
I'm not going inside! I'm not going inside!

06:54.750 --> 06:55.950
Look at her! Just look at her!

06:55.990 --> 06:56.830
She's doing this on purpose!

06:56.830 --> 06:57.930
It's all your fault!

07:00.750 --> 07:01.870
Stop it, okay?

07:01.870 --> 07:03.660
You wicked woman!

07:09.710 --> 07:10.510
What do you want?

07:10.630 --> 07:11.910
All of you, stop it!

07:11.910 --> 07:14.500
Who are you putting on a show for?

07:24.980 --> 07:25.670
Sister.

07:26.750 --> 07:27.750
Don't call me that.

07:27.780 --> 07:28.870
I'm not your sister.

07:29.190 --> 07:31.080
My father won't let you in our family.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.390
Why?

07:32.430 --> 07:33.270
You're just a little kid.

07:33.310 --> 07:34.820
I don't need to explain myself to you.

07:34.850 --> 07:37.170
I don't eat much, and I'm easy to feed.

07:37.200 --> 07:40.230
I also won't take the family inheritance away from you.

07:43.260 --> 07:44.500
Then why are you here?

07:44.870 --> 07:46.110
Before Grandma bought me,

07:46.130 --> 07:48.520
I hadn't eaten for three days.

07:48.550 --> 07:50.760
I want to live. I don't want to die.

07:58.920 --> 07:59.750
What do you want to eat?

07:59.770 --> 08:01.000
Let me think.

08:01.420 --> 08:01.850
Let's go.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.790
Fenghua!

08:03.700 --> 08:04.570
Fenghua!

08:05.110 --> 08:07.100
Do you know something happened to your family?

08:07.630 --> 08:08.900
Yeah, he just told me.

08:09.400 --> 08:10.400
So it's you.

08:10.890 --> 08:12.880
Behave yourself, you hear me?

08:12.960 --> 08:13.790
Pretty impressive.

08:15.530 --> 08:16.830
Your grandma must be crazy.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.310
How can she do something like this?

08:19.960 --> 08:21.150
You once said

08:21.350 --> 08:23.730
that you'd fight anyone who dared to bully me.

08:24.830 --> 08:26.820
My grandma, I'll leave her to you.

08:32.340 --> 08:34.020
You guys, give up already.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.539
I won't give birth to or raise any more children.

08:35.570 --> 08:38.110
I'm content with having one daughter in my life.

08:38.309 --> 08:39.809
If you want to complain about only having one male in three branches,

08:39.830 --> 08:41.010
you can raise him yourself.

08:42.159 --> 08:44.039
Let him be Maotian's little brother.

08:44.200 --> 08:45.430
Listen to her. Just listen.

08:45.430 --> 08:47.030
Is that how a human being talks?

08:47.060 --> 08:48.060
You're right.

08:48.460 --> 08:50.010
I'm not a human being.

08:50.060 --> 08:51.950
Ever since I married into Xia Family,

08:52.190 --> 08:53.270
I've been treated like a dog.

08:53.300 --> 08:54.730
I'm even worth less than a dog!

08:54.910 --> 08:56.130
The year I gave birth to Fenghua,

08:56.230 --> 08:57.410
during my postpartum confinement,

08:57.650 --> 08:59.240
did any of you ever cook a meal for me

08:59.300 --> 09:00.770
or wash a single diaper?

09:00.930 --> 09:03.570
Fenghua would cry all night long,

09:03.590 --> 09:04.500
and I would spend night after night

09:04.530 --> 09:06.500
pacing back and forth in the room, holding her.

09:06.810 --> 09:08.810
How many days did I go without a full night's sleep?

09:08.870 --> 09:10.570
But did any of you guys ever help me?

09:10.740 --> 09:12.940
Poor Fenghua had it even worse.

09:13.190 --> 09:14.510
Other children were loved by their grandma and grandpa,

09:14.530 --> 09:16.000
but not her.

09:16.080 --> 09:18.530
As soon as she was born and you saw she was a girl,

09:18.560 --> 09:19.700
you didn't even look at her.

09:19.750 --> 09:20.910
You just left.

09:21.280 --> 09:23.950
Whenever you saw her, you always belittled her with snide remarks.

09:24.590 --> 09:26.640
How do you think that made she feel?

09:28.030 --> 09:29.400
When she was little, she used to ask me,

09:29.440 --> 09:31.840
"Why does Grandma hate me so much?"

09:31.860 --> 09:33.220
"Am I really your child?"

09:33.250 --> 09:34.700
"Was I picked up by the river?"

09:34.720 --> 09:35.960
I wouldn't have picked her up even if I found her.

09:36.140 --> 09:37.490
I wouldn't have taken her even if she were given to us for free.

09:39.550 --> 09:41.190
I dare you guys to say that again!

09:41.220 --> 09:42.550
What if I say it again?

09:42.580 --> 09:43.190
I wouldn't have taken her even if she were given to us for free.

09:43.190 --> 09:43.750
Don't you dare

09:43.750 --> 09:44.910
say things like that about my daughter again!

09:44.940 --> 09:46.390
If you are so capable, give birth to a son yourself!

09:46.410 --> 09:47.380
What nonsense are you talking about?

09:48.130 --> 09:48.870
You know what?

09:48.870 --> 09:49.630
He is my son!

09:49.630 --> 09:50.550
I can't stand you people anymore!

09:50.550 --> 09:52.310
If you've got the guts, give me a boy!

09:52.310 --> 09:53.630
I'm very happy with the daughter I gave birth to!

09:53.630 --> 09:55.030
Why must I have a son?

09:55.310 --> 09:57.010
-Enough!
-I'm not ashamed at all!

09:58.870 --> 10:01.420
Will you guys ever stop?

10:02.120 --> 10:03.430
I'm begging you guys.

10:03.430 --> 10:05.760
Save me some face, okay?

10:08.350 --> 10:10.810
We'll discuss the child matter later.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.740
There's no room for discussion!

10:12.800 --> 10:14.320
Let me tell you, Xia Maotian.

10:15.150 --> 10:17.730
I, Li Yan, will only have one child in this lifetime,

10:18.470 --> 10:19.950
and that's our Fenghua!

10:20.430 --> 10:21.380
As for other people's children,

10:21.410 --> 10:22.630
whoever wants to raise them can do so.

10:23.060 --> 10:24.680
If you dare to give in,

10:25.570 --> 10:26.870
I'll divorce you!

10:33.790 --> 10:34.350
Brother.

10:34.680 --> 10:36.620
You are the head of the household.

10:51.910 --> 10:53.160
Eat slowly.

10:55.470 --> 10:56.290
Here you go.

11:02.340 --> 11:06.650
[Special price for a set: 18 yuan]

11:09.260 --> 11:10.070
What are you going to do?

11:11.800 --> 11:12.750
Don't worry.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.540
My mom will never agree.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.880
If she really gets pushed to her limit,

11:15.900 --> 11:17.150
she will divorce my dad.

11:17.730 --> 11:19.390
That's exactly what makes it troublesome.

11:19.830 --> 11:20.750
Your dad is filial.

11:20.790 --> 11:22.170
He always listens to your grandmother.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.880
If they really end up divorcing,

11:24.260 --> 11:25.680
you'll feel guilty, right?

11:32.230 --> 11:34.860
This kind of thing would never happen in your family.

11:36.070 --> 11:37.950
Things would be so much better if I were a boy.

11:46.270 --> 11:47.070
I think,

11:47.670 --> 11:50.120
your dad might not be able to handle this alone.

11:50.460 --> 11:51.380
We need to get help from the outside.

11:52.310 --> 11:53.070
What kind of help?

11:56.460 --> 11:57.480
Maotian.

11:57.630 --> 11:58.260
Maotian!

11:59.340 --> 12:00.680
Don't be a coward this time.

12:00.720 --> 12:01.670
Otherwise, your wife and daughter

12:01.680 --> 12:03.920
will be bullied to death by your mother.

12:04.860 --> 12:05.700
Boss Xie.

12:06.150 --> 12:07.790
I'm not stupid.

12:08.470 --> 12:10.800
How could I possibly agree to such a ridiculous thing?

12:10.820 --> 12:12.470
What did you tell your mother just now?

12:12.510 --> 12:14.160
You said you'd discuss it later!

12:14.700 --> 12:15.930
That's my mother.

12:16.180 --> 12:17.660
How can I disobey her?

12:17.860 --> 12:19.620
Well, disobedience,

12:19.690 --> 12:20.910
in the ancient times and

12:20.940 --> 12:22.700
in the Confucian culture,

12:22.730 --> 12:23.730
was considered unfilial.

12:23.760 --> 12:24.670
If you were unfilial,

12:24.700 --> 12:25.690
people might laugh at you,

12:25.720 --> 12:27.030
and you might even end up in jail.

12:27.050 --> 12:29.270
But what era are we living in now?

12:29.360 --> 12:31.240
You need to have a broader vision

12:31.260 --> 12:32.430
when tackling issues.

12:32.460 --> 12:34.060
You can't just stick to the old ways.

12:34.390 --> 12:36.220
No matter how society develops,

12:36.370 --> 12:37.590
people still need to be filial, right?

12:37.610 --> 12:39.170
Sure. Of course you should be filial,

12:39.190 --> 12:40.440
but you can't be blindly filial.

12:40.460 --> 12:41.550
Exactly!

12:41.820 --> 12:42.750
Let me tell you,

12:43.320 --> 12:44.320
at a time like this,

12:44.350 --> 12:46.840
if you don't think from your wife and daughter's perspective,

12:47.220 --> 12:48.400
and their hearts end up getting broken,

12:48.440 --> 12:49.280
there will be no turning back.

12:49.710 --> 12:50.670
It's too late already!

12:51.660 --> 12:53.040
Xia Maotian, listen to me.

12:53.070 --> 12:54.980
Go back and be your mom's filial son.

12:55.010 --> 12:55.970
From now on,

12:56.300 --> 12:57.440
I'll take care of Fenghua,

12:57.470 --> 12:58.350
and we'll live on our own.

12:58.530 --> 13:00.660
You go your way, and I'll go mine.

13:00.700 --> 13:02.150
From this point on, we part ways!

13:02.950 --> 13:03.700
Mom!

13:03.920 --> 13:05.070
What are you doing?

13:05.070 --> 13:05.910
You guys...

13:05.950 --> 13:06.430
Alright, stop it.

13:06.430 --> 13:07.550
We can live just fine without a man!

13:07.550 --> 13:08.390
Let's go! Let's go!

13:08.430 --> 13:08.830
Mom!

13:08.850 --> 13:10.340
Dad! Talk some sense into Mom!

13:10.390 --> 13:11.780
She's not just saying this out of anger!

13:11.780 --> 13:12.470
You see?

13:12.530 --> 13:13.560
She's always talking about getting a divorce!

13:13.590 --> 13:14.630
Always threatening to divorce me!

13:14.660 --> 13:15.930
I can't live like this anymore!

13:16.680 --> 13:17.680
Hey, you guys...

13:18.710 --> 13:19.660
Stand up!

13:22.720 --> 13:24.100
Act like a man!

13:35.210 --> 13:36.470
Mom, I...

13:36.490 --> 13:38.770
What kind of photo is this?

13:38.800 --> 13:39.760
So ugly.

13:45.960 --> 13:46.740
Mom.

13:47.310 --> 13:48.390
I've made up my mind.

13:49.110 --> 13:51.360
Yan and I can't raise this child.

13:51.380 --> 13:52.510
You must raise him!

13:52.850 --> 13:54.100
Our Xia family

13:54.130 --> 13:56.360
can't end with your generation.

13:56.550 --> 13:58.430
If you don't raise him, I'm not leaving!

13:58.540 --> 14:00.020
I'm going to live here!

14:01.470 --> 14:03.040
Living here seems quite nice.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.190
The bed is so soft and comfortable.

14:04.210 --> 14:06.050
Brother, why didn't you buy one for Mom?

14:06.190 --> 14:07.770
He doesn't care about me at all!

14:08.250 --> 14:08.950
Brother,

14:09.780 --> 14:11.670
don't get so worked up.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.090
We're not asking you to raise this child for real.

14:14.640 --> 14:16.800
We're going to take him back to the village with us later.

14:16.880 --> 14:17.970
All you need to do

14:18.000 --> 14:20.390
is transfer money to my card every month.

14:20.490 --> 14:21.670
This child's name

14:21.670 --> 14:22.830
will still be recorded in your family genealogy.

14:22.830 --> 14:23.910
Isn't that great?

14:23.950 --> 14:25.350
What era are we living in?

14:25.390 --> 14:27.030
Who still cares about family genealogy?

14:27.030 --> 14:28.070
I do!

14:28.190 --> 14:29.350
Your children

14:29.380 --> 14:31.150
and every following generation will!

14:31.860 --> 14:34.020
When we're alive, we are members of the Xia family,

14:34.070 --> 14:34.950
and even after we die,

14:34.980 --> 14:37.600
we'll be buried in the Xia family's ancestral grave!

14:38.280 --> 14:41.520
We... We cannot forget our ancestors!

14:41.550 --> 14:42.790
We can't.

14:48.630 --> 14:49.950
There are no outsiders here.

14:50.540 --> 14:53.490
You don't have to keep up the act anymore.

14:55.210 --> 14:56.550
What are you talking about?

14:56.580 --> 14:57.940
What act am I putting on?

14:57.980 --> 14:59.300
Stop acting, okay?

14:59.660 --> 15:00.900
Last week,

15:01.240 --> 15:02.860
the village secretary called me.

15:02.900 --> 15:04.850
What's a village secretary?

15:05.360 --> 15:07.620
He explained everything very clearly.

15:09.030 --> 15:10.270
What did he tell you?

15:10.310 --> 15:12.550
He said someone's interested in our village's land

15:13.610 --> 15:15.560
and wants to invest in developing a photovoltaic base.

15:15.600 --> 15:16.830
What's a photovoltaic base?

15:16.850 --> 15:17.570
Stop talking.

15:19.260 --> 15:20.180
The relocation compensation

15:20.760 --> 15:22.230
isn't a small amount, is it?

15:23.420 --> 15:24.950
Don't listen to

15:24.950 --> 15:25.950
his nonsense!

15:25.980 --> 15:27.540
Nothing has been decided yet!

15:27.580 --> 15:29.180
It's not even close to being finalized,

15:29.210 --> 15:30.910
yet he's already making plans for it!

15:31.070 --> 15:31.710
Don't listen to him!

15:31.710 --> 15:33.000
Don't you worry.

15:33.190 --> 15:35.340
I won't take a penny of that relocation money.

15:35.370 --> 15:36.900
You and Honghong can take it all.

15:36.930 --> 15:37.520
Brother!

15:37.550 --> 15:38.860
Keep your voice down!

15:39.760 --> 15:40.810
Brother...

15:40.830 --> 15:41.910
Brother, sit down.

15:41.930 --> 15:43.110
Don't be anxious.

15:43.130 --> 15:44.020
Listen.

15:44.040 --> 15:45.660
I won't agree with this.

15:45.690 --> 15:46.790
No matter what,

15:46.810 --> 15:48.220
you're still a part of the Xia family,

15:48.260 --> 15:50.580
and you're the only male. As long as...

15:50.610 --> 15:52.640
Let me finish first.

15:54.000 --> 15:55.360
We won't take the money,

15:55.990 --> 15:58.040
but you have to take the child with you.

15:58.180 --> 15:59.840
If you don't trust me,

16:00.370 --> 16:02.190
we can go to the notary office

16:02.210 --> 16:04.490
and sign a transferring contract for the relocation compensation.

16:05.900 --> 16:07.170
But I'm begging you guys,

16:07.760 --> 16:08.550
from now on,

16:08.570 --> 16:10.570
don't come and upset my wife and daughter anymore.

16:10.610 --> 16:11.570
Can you do that?

16:11.600 --> 16:14.700
Those two... They're my life.

16:14.920 --> 16:18.300
Brother. We won't do that. We won't.

16:18.320 --> 16:20.230
Mom is just looking out for you,

16:20.310 --> 16:21.070
you know?

16:21.330 --> 16:22.550
Don't interrupt.

16:24.190 --> 16:26.640
Does Yan agree to this?

16:28.080 --> 16:30.080
If you take this child away,

16:30.740 --> 16:33.790
we can earn the money ourselves.

16:34.000 --> 16:36.150
So, this is settled then.

16:36.180 --> 16:38.110
Don't come saying that I forced you into this.

16:38.130 --> 16:39.110
Do you hear me?

16:39.510 --> 16:40.540
I'm doing this willingly.

16:40.770 --> 16:41.900
I won't go back on my word!

16:42.510 --> 16:43.230
Fenghua.

16:44.000 --> 16:44.860
It's okay.

16:44.890 --> 16:45.980
You know,

16:46.500 --> 16:48.310
your father actually loves you very much.

16:48.340 --> 16:49.220
Don't worry.

16:49.240 --> 16:51.240
He won't let anyone hurt you.

16:52.860 --> 16:54.130
Why are you crying?

16:54.170 --> 16:56.110
You're usually so talkative,

16:56.150 --> 16:57.850
but you fall apart at crucial moments.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.610
Alright, alright.

16:58.630 --> 16:59.590
I'm scared...

16:59.620 --> 17:00.500
Why are you scared?

17:00.520 --> 17:01.860
Your parents are still alive!

17:01.960 --> 17:03.230
Whoever dares to bully my daughter,

17:03.260 --> 17:04.460
I'll fight them to death!

17:06.040 --> 17:07.380
Fenghua.

17:08.230 --> 17:09.380
Fenghua.

17:10.470 --> 17:11.700
Let me say a few words.

17:12.589 --> 17:14.240
A good dog doesn't block the way.

17:14.270 --> 17:15.609
Sorry, I'll make way for you.

17:15.890 --> 17:17.040
I'm not talking about you.

17:17.589 --> 17:18.560
Fenghua.

17:18.579 --> 17:21.000
Grandma was thoughtless this time.

17:21.069 --> 17:22.540
I'm sorry for the trouble I've caused you two.

17:22.569 --> 17:23.730
I was wrong.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.390
From now on,

17:24.430 --> 17:25.329
just

17:25.359 --> 17:27.220
listen to your parents

17:27.250 --> 17:28.200
and be filial to them.

17:28.720 --> 17:29.640
Grandma's leaving now.

17:29.670 --> 17:30.390
You talk.

17:31.420 --> 17:32.430
What about the child?

17:32.520 --> 17:34.520
Didn't you say you wouldn't raise this child?

17:34.560 --> 17:36.290
I'll take him back, and someone will raise him.

17:36.330 --> 17:38.860
Our family isn't the only one in the village short of male heirs.

17:39.080 --> 17:41.880
If you don't want him, others will.

17:43.510 --> 17:44.030
Sister!

17:44.540 --> 17:45.890
Let's go, let's go.

17:47.120 --> 17:47.740
We're leaving.

17:47.790 --> 17:48.390
Take care.

17:48.420 --> 17:48.760
Come on.

17:48.790 --> 17:49.430
Maotian.

17:50.050 --> 17:52.390
This... I just bought this!

17:52.430 --> 17:53.990
Buy another one.

17:56.510 --> 17:58.490
The rice is still in the cooker!

17:58.740 --> 17:59.870
Mom! Mom!

18:02.980 --> 18:03.980
Alright, I'm leaving now.

18:04.000 --> 18:05.490
I was cooking, too.

18:05.520 --> 18:06.490
Alright. Alright.

18:11.110 --> 18:11.990
So they gave in?

18:12.020 --> 18:12.630
Yeah, they did.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.080
Hey.

18:16.390 --> 18:17.260
We'll buy another one.

18:17.630 --> 18:18.910
Don't give everything...

18:18.950 --> 18:19.790
Alright, alright.

18:19.830 --> 18:21.110
Go back, no need to see us off.

18:21.190 --> 18:22.070
Give this to me.

18:22.100 --> 18:22.780
Hurry up and go.

18:22.790 --> 18:24.130
No need to see us off.

18:24.890 --> 18:26.190
Uncle, it's that kid!

18:26.220 --> 18:26.930
Okay.

18:31.270 --> 18:32.150
Don't block the way.

18:32.170 --> 18:33.690
If we're late, we'll miss the bus.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.260
Don't rush, old lady.

18:35.420 --> 18:36.660
Excuse me, may I ask

18:36.680 --> 18:37.880
what your relationship with this child is?

18:37.980 --> 18:38.790
He is...

18:38.870 --> 18:40.390
He's my relative's child.

18:40.410 --> 18:41.620
Do you have his ID card?

18:41.650 --> 18:42.860
He's too young,

18:42.890 --> 18:43.630
so we haven't had the chance to get him one yet.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.570
She bought me...

18:44.600 --> 18:45.550
Don't talk nonsense!

18:45.570 --> 18:46.590
If you keep talking nonsense, I'll beat you!

18:46.630 --> 18:48.030
I'll actually beat you!

18:48.200 --> 18:49.000
Come here.

18:49.910 --> 18:50.560
Come on.

18:51.220 --> 18:52.030
Little boy.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.590
-I'm a police officer.
-What's going on now?

18:54.620 --> 18:56.610
Don't be afraid. Say whatever you want.

18:56.660 --> 18:57.630
Officer.

18:57.670 --> 18:58.990
I lied to you just now.

18:59.020 --> 19:01.560
We actually picked up this child on the street.

19:01.590 --> 19:02.640
I've heard of picking up money,

19:02.670 --> 19:03.520
but picking up a child?

19:04.190 --> 19:05.810
You think police officers are that easy to fool?

19:05.830 --> 19:07.380
Officer, please save me!

19:07.420 --> 19:09.230
Bad people kidnapped me.

19:09.260 --> 19:10.530
My dad's name is Zhang Liangyong.

19:10.560 --> 19:11.940
My mom's name is Liu Cuiying.

19:11.970 --> 19:14.510
I don't know where my home is. I've forgotten everything.

19:14.540 --> 19:15.110
Come on.

19:16.470 --> 19:17.670
Come with me.

19:17.780 --> 19:18.390
Come here.

19:20.430 --> 19:21.910
Child trafficking, huh?

19:22.290 --> 19:24.570
No, Officer!

19:24.600 --> 19:25.480
Get up first.

19:25.510 --> 19:26.070
Come on, get up.

19:26.090 --> 19:26.590
Stand up and talk.

19:27.250 --> 19:28.820
Our family needs a male heir,

19:28.840 --> 19:30.640
and the neighbors had two boys,

19:30.670 --> 19:32.140
so they gave us one.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.660
I even had to pay them!

19:33.720 --> 19:35.630
I don't know anything else!

19:35.710 --> 19:37.390
Brother, help our mom!

19:37.390 --> 19:37.710
Shen.

19:37.710 --> 19:38.410
Shen.

19:38.490 --> 19:39.880
This must be a misunderstanding.

19:39.880 --> 19:41.140
This must be a misunderstanding!

19:41.170 --> 19:43.640
My mom is uneducated and doesn't understand the law.

19:43.870 --> 19:45.580
She's old and muddled.

19:45.620 --> 19:47.320
We'll leave the child to you.

19:47.340 --> 19:48.760
Please forgive my mom.

19:48.800 --> 19:50.590
Whether to forgive her or not is not up to me to decide.

19:50.710 --> 19:52.390
It depends on what she's done.

19:52.410 --> 19:53.820
-Old lady.
-I didn't do anything!

19:53.820 --> 19:55.110
You can't leave now.

19:55.140 --> 19:57.020
You need to come back to the station with me

19:57.190 --> 19:58.190
and clarify the situation.

19:58.190 --> 19:59.630
I won't!

20:00.950 --> 20:01.590
Stop right there!

20:01.670 --> 20:02.660
I said stop!

20:02.680 --> 20:03.790
You have to come back with me!

20:03.800 --> 20:04.980
You have to come back with me!

20:05.410 --> 20:06.160
Dad!

20:06.630 --> 20:07.390
I won't go!

20:07.420 --> 20:09.110
I can't go.

20:10.070 --> 20:11.690
Isn't this going too far?

20:12.260 --> 20:13.670
As I said before,

20:13.700 --> 20:15.860
I'll fight anyone who dares to bully you.

20:16.240 --> 20:17.700
But she's my grandma.

20:18.280 --> 20:19.300
Having second thoughts?

20:19.610 --> 20:20.340
Alright then.

20:20.390 --> 20:22.830
I'll ask the court to reduce her sentence by a few years.

20:24.670 --> 20:27.210
Fenghua, don't always repay kindness with ingratitude, okay?

20:27.230 --> 20:28.780
Next time you're in trouble, don't come to me.

20:28.800 --> 20:30.660
I'll just watch you cry yourself to death.

20:30.700 --> 20:31.720
You wouldn't be able to bear it.

20:31.740 --> 20:33.330
Why wouldn't I?

20:33.370 --> 20:34.580
I was born to be wicked,

20:34.680 --> 20:35.740
and you're destined to be tortured.

20:35.780 --> 20:37.940
Your tears are my medals!

20:38.390 --> 20:39.270
Try saying that again!

20:38.840 --> 20:39.550
[Flower Street]

20:39.310 --> 20:40.100
Stop right there!

20:40.520 --> 20:42.170
You... I dare you to say that again!

21:16.140 --> 21:17.560
Don't catch a cold.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.910
The police looked into the situation

21:29.100 --> 21:31.910
and gave your grandma a punishment and a reprimand.

21:33.180 --> 21:35.310
It almost scared the old lady to death.

21:36.870 --> 21:38.180
Whether it's the buyer or the seller,

21:38.350 --> 21:39.350
child trafficking

21:39.350 --> 21:40.230
is morally wrong.

21:41.150 --> 21:42.590
They should all be sentenced to death.

21:42.680 --> 21:43.470
Don't talk nonsense.

21:50.220 --> 21:51.060
Fenghua.

21:55.190 --> 21:55.890
I...

21:57.150 --> 21:58.150
I'm sorry.

22:03.890 --> 22:04.870
Rest assured.

22:05.220 --> 22:06.830
If anything like this happens again,

22:09.230 --> 22:10.770
I'll confront them right away

22:11.400 --> 22:13.270
without giving face to anyone.

22:16.790 --> 22:17.940
It's not necessary.

22:18.110 --> 22:18.830
It is.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.750
I don't have much in this life

22:24.750 --> 22:26.750
that I can be proud of.

22:28.180 --> 22:30.210
The only thing I can boast about to others

22:32.700 --> 22:33.500
is

22:36.170 --> 22:37.200
my daughter.

22:40.140 --> 22:40.850
Dad...

22:44.910 --> 22:46.540
Thank you, Daughter,

22:49.300 --> 22:51.130
for allowing me to

22:53.410 --> 22:55.000
stand up

22:58.510 --> 22:59.820
and be a real man at the crucial moment.

23:17.910 --> 23:19.270
Be careful, Boss Xie.

23:19.990 --> 23:21.450
You're having a day off today?

23:21.470 --> 23:22.220
That's right.

23:24.500 --> 23:25.830
Boss Xie, come take a look at the vegetables.

23:25.850 --> 23:26.800
I've bought everything.

23:26.840 --> 23:27.480
I see.

23:27.510 --> 23:28.350
Boss Xie, you're done shopping?

23:28.370 --> 23:29.170
Buy from me next time.

23:29.230 --> 23:30.400
Alright, I'll buy from you next time.

23:35.180 --> 23:36.090
Hey...

23:36.320 --> 23:37.640
Boss Xie, you're here.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.800
These fish need some oxygen.

23:38.820 --> 23:40.560
Look, their bellies are already facing up.

23:41.210 --> 23:42.410
Don't get me started.

23:42.460 --> 23:44.120
I can't even sell the live ones.

23:44.220 --> 23:46.280
Boss Xie, why don't you buy some?

23:46.470 --> 23:47.640
Given our relationship,

23:47.940 --> 23:49.090
I'll give you 40% off.

23:49.120 --> 23:50.120
40%?

23:50.820 --> 23:51.730
Then if I buy the ones with their bellies up,

23:51.760 --> 23:53.430
can you make it even cheaper?

23:53.600 --> 23:55.430
Boss Xie, the belly-up ones don't taste good.

23:55.450 --> 23:56.100
Buy the live ones.

23:56.230 --> 23:59.070
They're all going to die in the end anyway.

23:59.090 --> 24:00.530
I'll just buy two of these belly-up ones.

24:00.570 --> 24:01.770
Give me a better price, okay?

24:01.830 --> 24:03.350
Welcome.

24:06.270 --> 24:07.920
I'll pick two out for you.

24:07.920 --> 24:10.910
Big sale today. Welcome.

24:11.420 --> 24:13.740
Flower Street Floating Supermarket.

24:13.780 --> 24:18.020
Big sale today. Welcome.

24:14.350 --> 24:18.300
[Floating Supermarket]

24:18.670 --> 24:19.590
-Maotian!
-Boss Xie!

24:21.520 --> 24:22.680
I see

24:23.170 --> 24:25.220
the floating supermarket is really up and running now.

24:25.250 --> 24:26.170
Yes, yes.

24:26.200 --> 24:26.990
Right?

24:27.590 --> 24:28.310
That's great.

24:29.580 --> 24:30.660
Buying groceries?

24:30.740 --> 24:32.310
Just our for a stroll.

24:32.330 --> 24:32.950
Alright.

24:33.350 --> 24:34.140
Keep up the good work!

24:34.140 --> 24:35.110
Okay.

24:36.550 --> 24:40.630
Big sale today. Welcome.

24:41.850 --> 24:44.080
Flower Street Floating Supermarket.

24:44.280 --> 24:48.650
Big sale today. Welcome.

24:49.300 --> 24:51.800
Flower Street Floating Supermarket.

24:51.910 --> 24:56.310
Big sale today. Welcome.

25:00.020 --> 25:01.150
Come on.

25:01.190 --> 25:02.070
Press the clutch all the way down.

25:02.070 --> 25:02.590
I did.

25:02.590 --> 25:03.420
Press the clutch all the way down.

25:03.420 --> 25:04.390
Come on, let me help you shift gears.

25:04.390 --> 25:05.310
Move your hand away.

25:05.430 --> 25:06.470
Release the clutch slowly.

25:07.860 --> 25:08.970
Step on the gas slowly.

25:09.870 --> 25:10.610
Step on the gas.

25:10.650 --> 25:11.420
Step on the gas.

25:11.500 --> 25:12.770
Step on the gas!

25:16.640 --> 25:18.520
I've never seen anyone so clumsy.

25:18.560 --> 25:19.560
Instructor!

25:20.390 --> 25:22.250
Give me one more chance!

25:23.810 --> 25:24.800
Instructor!

25:26.410 --> 25:27.380
Instructor!

25:58.670 --> 26:00.070
What's wrong with you again?

26:02.430 --> 26:03.550
Go do your homework.

26:15.910 --> 26:16.500
Dad.

26:17.230 --> 26:19.430
Is it because Uncle Xia opened a floating supermarket

26:19.450 --> 26:20.600
and you're not happy about it?

26:20.630 --> 26:21.550
Get lost!

26:31.210 --> 26:33.730
Dad, why don't you open one, too?

26:33.950 --> 26:36.060
With your connections, you'd definitely make money.

26:39.390 --> 26:40.700
If you have something to say, just spit it out.

26:40.730 --> 26:42.000
Don't keep it bottled up and make yourself sick.

26:43.660 --> 26:45.690
It's not that I can't open one,

26:46.630 --> 26:47.270
but if I do,

26:47.270 --> 26:49.390
wouldn't I be stealing your Uncle Xia's business?

26:50.000 --> 26:51.300
That's called being shameless.

26:56.990 --> 26:58.110
So what do you plan to do?

27:13.990 --> 27:15.220
What are you looking for?

27:15.690 --> 27:16.830
The invoice for the ship I bought.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.150
Your mom should have put it here.

27:20.230 --> 27:21.160
This one.

27:21.880 --> 27:23.470
It should be this one.

27:23.740 --> 27:24.920
I'm thinking,

27:25.910 --> 27:27.350
if things really don't work out,

27:27.350 --> 27:28.820
then I... I'll have to...

27:30.090 --> 27:33.240
[Yunqi Driving School Training Price List]

27:34.240 --> 27:36.150
Who... Who went to learn driving?

27:44.730 --> 27:48.070
[Yunqi Driving School Training Price List]

28:22.990 --> 28:24.340
Why aren't you asleep yet?

28:28.440 --> 28:29.640
You went to learn how to drive a truck?

28:39.630 --> 28:41.870
Why didn't you discuss this with me beforehand?

28:45.580 --> 28:48.220
Driving a truck is not a job for women.

28:48.330 --> 28:50.290
Take Zhang as an example. Driving a truck

28:50.310 --> 28:51.700
caused him so many health problems,

28:52.110 --> 28:53.110
like kidney stones

28:53.110 --> 28:54.540
and herniated discs.

28:56.010 --> 28:56.910
This...

28:56.910 --> 28:59.110
The money he earned wasn't even enough to cover his hospital bills.

28:59.510 --> 29:00.670
Why did you do that?

29:05.180 --> 29:07.050
Have you checked our family's finances?

29:10.710 --> 29:12.760
Do you know how much money

29:12.790 --> 29:14.070
our family has left now?

29:14.090 --> 29:15.450
If we're short on money, I can go out and earn some.

29:16.590 --> 29:17.420
How?

29:18.890 --> 29:20.480
Besides seafaring,

29:21.350 --> 29:22.430
what else can you do?

29:24.030 --> 29:26.440
You're right. I can't do anything else.

29:26.910 --> 29:27.590
I can't do anything.

29:34.590 --> 29:36.480
Even Xia Maotian knows to find a backup plan.

29:37.310 --> 29:38.110
What about you?

29:39.150 --> 29:40.510
You do nothing every day,

29:40.910 --> 29:41.740
just sitting around.

29:42.670 --> 29:44.920
If it were just our family struggling,

29:45.150 --> 29:47.110
we could manage by being frugal.

29:47.630 --> 29:48.700
But our family

29:49.360 --> 29:50.680
still owes

29:50.870 --> 29:52.390
so many dividends to the neighbors.

29:53.070 --> 29:54.150
Are we not paying them back?

29:55.550 --> 29:56.560
Then what?

29:56.990 --> 29:58.030
Our whole family just

29:58.390 --> 29:59.900
run away from debts?

30:09.790 --> 30:11.310
I know you care about me

30:11.820 --> 30:12.910
and worry about me suffering.

30:15.220 --> 30:16.390
But now,

30:18.290 --> 30:19.730
we really have no way out.

30:22.630 --> 30:25.630
In the past, you carried the burden alone.

30:26.310 --> 30:26.990
Now,

30:28.900 --> 30:30.650
let's carry it together.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.140
You can save some energy.

30:43.230 --> 30:44.990
Xia's floating supermarket

30:45.030 --> 30:46.250
has already started making a profit.

30:46.660 --> 30:47.720
How about...

31:33.670 --> 31:37.880
[The main framework of China's national highway network, the "five vertical and seven horizontal" national trunk lines, is basically connected.]

31:34.270 --> 31:35.830
The traffic industry development statistics announcement

31:35.830 --> 31:38.710
released by the Ministry of Transport in 2006 shows that

31:38.710 --> 31:39.950
by the end of 2006,

31:39.950 --> 31:41.190
the total length of highways in China was

31:41.190 --> 31:43.490
3,457,000 kilometers.

31:43.510 --> 31:45.070
The number of commercial vehicles on highways nationwide was

31:45.070 --> 31:46.910
8,025,800.

31:47.070 --> 31:48.110
The completed highway investment was

31:48.110 --> 31:50.190
623,105,000,000 yuan.

31:50.470 --> 31:52.850
The total investment exceeded 1,500,000,000,000 yuan.

31:52.880 --> 31:54.430
It is estimated that by 2010,

31:54.430 --> 31:56.550
the operational mileage will reach 85,600 kilometers.

31:57.280 --> 31:59.630
The highway mileage in various regions continues to grow.

31:59.720 --> 32:01.040
The length of the expressways in the eastern region

32:01.070 --> 32:03.070
is 20,279 kilometers.

32:03.120 --> 32:04.450
The length of the expressways in the central region

32:04.500 --> 32:06.880
is 13,339 kilometers.

32:06.910 --> 32:08.230
The length of the expressways in the western region

32:08.260 --> 32:10.380
is 11,717 kilometers.

32:11.020 --> 32:13.420
New achievements have been made in expressway construction.

32:16.300 --> 32:17.270
Sir. Sir.

32:17.290 --> 32:19.090
The results are out.

32:19.130 --> 32:19.810
Our class's results.

32:20.110 --> 32:21.970
Please stop writing and take a look at this first.

32:24.870 --> 32:25.470
How is it?

32:25.600 --> 32:27.870
Drilling is starting to pay off.

32:28.360 --> 32:29.840
For this set of practice test from Jiangxi,

32:29.870 --> 32:31.870
I initially estimated the average score to be be around

32:31.900 --> 32:33.360
84 points or so.

32:33.780 --> 32:34.690
But it turns out to be

32:34.760 --> 32:36.240
[Average score: 92]

32:35.230 --> 32:36.390
92!

32:37.030 --> 32:39.540
Our class's average score has passed 60, Sir!

32:40.710 --> 32:42.000
For real.

32:42.060 --> 32:43.730
There's another joint exam next week.

32:43.760 --> 32:45.120
No. 1 High School will also be participating.

32:45.140 --> 32:46.980
I'm already looking forward to it.

32:47.010 --> 32:48.980
If you can really catch up with No. 1 High School's scores,

32:49.940 --> 32:51.500
that would make me so proud.

32:54.410 --> 32:56.520
It seems I'll have to make a visit

32:56.540 --> 32:57.570
to Principal Fang's school next to us.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.090
I'm looking forward to it.

33:01.540 --> 33:03.620
As long as your class's average score passes 60,

33:03.640 --> 33:04.700
I'll treat you to a meal.

33:05.810 --> 33:06.490
Alright!

33:07.080 --> 33:08.940
If we pass, you'll treat our whole class to a meal.

33:09.020 --> 33:09.560
Deal.

33:10.850 --> 33:11.950
What?

33:12.530 --> 33:13.690
Isn't that what you just said?

33:13.710 --> 33:14.530
Treat us to a meal.

33:15.130 --> 33:16.070
Thank you, Sir!

33:26.520 --> 33:31.180
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

33:42.360 --> 33:45.220
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

33:42.960 --> 33:43.590
Alright, alright.

33:43.630 --> 33:44.310
Stop writing now.

33:44.390 --> 33:45.350
Time's up.

33:45.390 --> 33:46.170
Hand in your papers.

33:58.390 --> 33:59.370
Well...

33:59.400 --> 34:01.270
There's another set of practice exam tomorrow.

34:01.910 --> 34:03.700
It's from Jiangxi Normal University Affiliated High School.

34:04.640 --> 34:05.520
There's more?

34:05.550 --> 34:07.910
Drilling every day, we're going to die from this!

34:07.940 --> 34:10.690
Teacher, I haven't slept well for over a week.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.380
I didn't sleep well either.

34:11.409 --> 34:13.219
Alright, alright, everyone stop complaining.

34:13.239 --> 34:14.489
You're just being delicate.

34:14.510 --> 34:15.830
Do you know how much effort

34:15.870 --> 34:17.260
the principal put into getting these test papers?

34:17.290 --> 34:19.010
Don't take your blessings for granted.

34:20.560 --> 34:22.080
Everyone, be safe on your way home after school.

34:22.150 --> 34:23.790
Okay...

34:32.989 --> 34:33.710
Why are you looking at me?

34:33.710 --> 34:34.790
Is there something on my face?

34:35.230 --> 34:36.469
Your grades are poor,

34:36.500 --> 34:37.770
so of course you need drilling.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.199
Why are you dragging us down with you?

34:40.070 --> 34:41.900
You can slack off if you don't want to do the practice test.

34:41.940 --> 34:43.010
No one's forcing you.

34:43.050 --> 34:44.460
They rank our scores after each practice test,

34:44.460 --> 34:45.800
three times a week.

34:46.340 --> 34:48.060
Are you trying to drive us mad?

34:48.080 --> 34:49.760
Hey, this is the school's arrangement.

34:49.790 --> 34:50.760
What does it have to do with me?

34:50.780 --> 34:52.360
You wrote the proposal, didn't you?

34:52.780 --> 34:54.820
Fine, you can blame everything on me.

34:55.190 --> 34:56.760
Alright, alright. I wrote it.

34:56.800 --> 34:57.790
It's my fault for dragging you down.

34:57.790 --> 34:58.910
I apologize to all of you.

34:58.990 --> 35:00.770
How about I treat everyone to a late-night snack?

35:03.640 --> 35:04.770
Drilling every day is so exhausting.

35:04.830 --> 35:06.170
No one will be grateful to you for this.

35:06.490 --> 35:07.390
When the time comes

35:07.390 --> 35:09.590
and everyone gets into college because of this drilling you proposed,

35:09.610 --> 35:10.770
they still won't be grateful to you.

35:10.830 --> 35:11.710
I will.

35:12.830 --> 35:14.170
I'll thank your whole family.

35:17.290 --> 35:18.080
Let's go. Let's go.

35:18.110 --> 35:18.850
Fenghua.

35:18.870 --> 35:19.670
Fenghua.

35:19.700 --> 35:22.020
Go home and sleep. You've been sleeping all day.

35:25.200 --> 35:26.840
Where's my test paper?

35:27.140 --> 35:28.870
Already handed in.

35:32.170 --> 35:33.900
Why didn't anyone wait for me?

35:36.180 --> 35:37.210
Stop laughing.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.810
I'm going to the internet cafe

35:42.830 --> 35:44.410
to look up some information on ship selling.

35:44.630 --> 35:46.060
Also, there's a test problem from today

35:46.230 --> 35:48.110
which I think has a better solution to it.

35:48.130 --> 35:49.360
You can't be serious.

35:49.580 --> 35:51.110
Are you planning a chakra explosion or something?

35:51.110 --> 35:52.110
What else can I do?

35:52.240 --> 35:53.390
It's not like I have Sharingan.

35:53.390 --> 35:54.230
If I don't power up soon,

35:54.230 --> 35:56.070
who am I going to copy from during the official exam?

35:56.100 --> 35:56.690
What...

35:57.220 --> 35:57.940
I'm coming, too.

36:02.270 --> 36:03.660
What's wrong with these guys?

36:11.340 --> 36:12.330
Xie.

36:12.790 --> 36:14.670
It's not that I don't want to help you.

36:15.470 --> 36:17.530
But, indeed,

36:17.710 --> 36:19.110
I'm willing but unable to.

36:20.360 --> 36:23.210
You know that I used to have over a dozen ships.

36:23.650 --> 36:24.480
But later,

36:24.480 --> 36:26.510
I didn't make any profit, you know?

36:26.750 --> 36:29.170
I've gradually sold six of them already.

36:29.390 --> 36:30.620
I'll be honest with you,

36:31.580 --> 36:32.540
I don't know

36:32.570 --> 36:34.370
what to do with the rest.

36:35.430 --> 36:36.510
So,

36:37.860 --> 36:39.510
as for your ship,

36:40.230 --> 36:41.500
I really can't take it on.

36:44.460 --> 36:45.070
Well,

36:46.860 --> 36:49.180
how about a discount?

36:49.870 --> 36:51.080
How much of a discount?

36:54.130 --> 36:54.990
15%.

36:55.520 --> 36:57.720
How much? 15%?

36:58.870 --> 36:59.800
Xie.

37:01.840 --> 37:03.630
Let me tell you something you might not want to hear.

37:03.910 --> 37:05.380
That old ship of yours,

37:05.430 --> 37:06.860
how many years has it been running?

37:07.130 --> 37:09.660
Do you know that no one would take it even at half price?

37:11.140 --> 37:12.350
When you have time,

37:12.350 --> 37:14.190
go out and see the world more.

37:14.220 --> 37:15.810
Who's still

37:17.210 --> 37:19.080
using ships for cargo transportation these days?

37:20.270 --> 37:22.630
Every trip by ship is guaranteed to lose money.

37:28.590 --> 37:29.190
Alright.

37:33.360 --> 37:36.310
I'll do you a favor and ask around in Taizhou.

37:37.670 --> 37:39.140
Convert that old ship of yours

37:39.580 --> 37:40.610
into a fishing boat.

37:44.710 --> 37:46.390
But converting the ship costs money, too.

37:46.390 --> 37:48.070
Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?

37:52.520 --> 37:53.300
Look.

37:54.030 --> 37:54.910
I'll be honest with you.

37:54.910 --> 37:57.110
The money from my neighbors,

37:57.660 --> 38:00.560
the dividends, I haven't paid them back yet.

38:00.950 --> 38:03.400
My wife asked me whenever she saw me

38:03.400 --> 38:04.190
when

38:04.190 --> 38:05.820
I could bring the money home.

38:06.730 --> 38:08.040
What kind of life is this?

38:08.070 --> 38:09.070
Xie.

38:10.830 --> 38:11.910
At least

38:11.940 --> 38:13.460
it's a desperate solution, right?

38:13.480 --> 38:15.650
G-Give it more thought.

38:18.940 --> 38:19.780
Eat.

38:20.360 --> 38:20.950
You eat.

38:26.620 --> 38:30.040
[Ship Trading] [Ship Building] [Ship Repair] [Ship Agency]

38:30.070 --> 38:32.520
[Comprehensive Search] [Contact Information]

38:37.910 --> 38:39.580
Will it work now that we put this online?

38:41.030 --> 38:42.750
It's better than just waiting at home, right?

38:49.570 --> 38:51.320
Ships are hard to sell these days.

38:52.450 --> 38:53.660
It might be able to sell

38:53.690 --> 38:54.520
on the internet.

38:55.160 --> 38:55.870
Hey.

38:56.190 --> 38:57.230
If you really sell it,

38:57.260 --> 38:58.720
what about your dad?

39:02.060 --> 39:03.160
We'll see about that.

39:03.510 --> 39:06.600
A grown man can't be defeated so easily.

39:07.330 --> 39:09.130
I don't have any other ideas right now anyways.

39:09.970 --> 39:11.240
I'll give it one last shot.

39:11.570 --> 39:13.160
If I can get into college,

39:13.840 --> 39:15.370
my dad will definitely be able to pull himself together.

39:15.550 --> 39:16.860
I'll set an example for him.

39:18.750 --> 39:20.870
Your dad is a capable man after all.

39:20.900 --> 39:21.920
He doesn't need you to set an example for him.

39:24.580 --> 39:27.160
Have you guys seen what my dad looks like on the ship?

39:27.420 --> 39:28.390
Head held high,

39:28.420 --> 39:29.410
full of vigor,

39:29.630 --> 39:31.680
as if he dug the canal himself.

39:33.710 --> 39:34.880
When the ship was sold,

39:35.810 --> 39:37.120
my dad would be dispirited.

39:38.690 --> 39:40.590
I can't bear to see him like that.

39:41.000 --> 39:42.660
My mom is suffering, too.

39:43.670 --> 39:46.250
New gray hair grows at her temples every day.

39:46.280 --> 39:47.490
Can't even pluck it all.

39:49.640 --> 39:51.310
When I see the gray hair,

39:52.800 --> 39:54.570
my heart feels like it's being pricked by needles.

40:03.270 --> 40:04.360
Right now,

40:04.390 --> 40:05.870
I don't have any grand plans.

40:04.450 --> 40:11.660
[Comprehensive Search] [Contact Information]

40:07.140 --> 40:08.310
I just wish

40:09.090 --> 40:10.670
my parents don't have to work so hard.

40:13.390 --> 40:14.390
As for everything else,

40:16.540 --> 40:18.160
I don't think it's that important anymore.

40:53.110 --> 40:55.190
Why did you drink so much?

40:56.740 --> 40:57.980
Here, water.

41:20.190 --> 41:21.190
Son...

41:22.400 --> 41:23.200
I

41:24.520 --> 41:25.970
am sorry.

41:31.340 --> 41:32.330
If only

41:33.040 --> 41:34.480
I were more capable

41:35.220 --> 41:36.610
and could make money,

41:38.310 --> 41:39.510
I wouldn't...

41:39.540 --> 41:42.460
I wouldn't hold you back in your studies.

41:44.950 --> 41:45.790
But

41:46.450 --> 41:47.570
But I

41:48.980 --> 41:50.570
really tried my best.

41:51.150 --> 41:52.200
I've done my best.

41:55.580 --> 41:56.900
In my life,

41:58.580 --> 42:00.010
apart from seafaring,

42:01.140 --> 42:02.630
I don't know how to do anything else.

42:08.390 --> 42:09.180
But...

42:10.240 --> 42:12.580
But you... You have potential.

42:13.520 --> 42:15.170
Y-You can do it.

42:17.910 --> 42:18.710
Your father...

42:20.190 --> 42:22.200
Your father is useless.

42:24.340 --> 42:25.780
Looked down upon by others...

42:27.630 --> 42:28.910
But my son...

42:31.110 --> 42:33.700
Y-You must be successful.

42:35.690 --> 42:36.480
You need to...

42:37.180 --> 42:40.190
Regain the face I've lost

42:41.730 --> 42:43.010
for me.

42:45.460 --> 42:46.520
Please.

42:47.630 --> 42:48.640
Please.
